{"aliases": ["かがみねのお茶会", "Kagamine no Ocha Kai", "KagaOcha", "かがみね茶道部", "Kagamine Sadoubu"], "dates": "2016.03.06", "circles": [{"aliases": ["緒久屋"], "pen_names": ["緒方久乃"], "position": "H - 01", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/緒久屋.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/緒久屋.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://kusharee.blog101.fc2.com/", "https://twitter.com/ogatahisano", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=22177"], "comments": "鏡音でカップリングできるキーホルダー"}, {"aliases": ["兎水月"], "pen_names": ["天宮瑞貴"], "position": "H - 02", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/兎水月.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/兎水月.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/alicemizuki", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=2975432"], "comments": "人形・小説本ばかりのサークルです。頑張ってかわいい鏡音を目指しますのでよろしくお願いします（・＋・＊）"}, {"aliases": ["みずがめや"], "pen_names": ["ラーク"], "position": "H - 03", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/みずがめや.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/みずがめや.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/mizugameya"]}, {"aliases": ["かがみね茶"], "pen_names": ["半月、yoku"], "position": "H - 04", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/かがみね茶.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/かがみね茶.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://kagamine-cha.jp/", "https://twitter.com/kgmncha"], "comments": "ふともも！ふともも缶バッジ！"}, {"aliases": ["ギンユーシジン"], "pen_names": ["冴戒椎也"], "position": "H - 10", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/ギンユーシジン.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/ギンユーシジン.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://ameblo.jp/shiiyasakai/", "https://twitter.com/sakaishiiya", "http://www.nicovideo.jp/user/25798866"], "comments": "めでたく第2弾の制作が決まったもじゅみねイメージソングコンピなど、リンレン中心のオリジナル曲CDを色々持っていきます！"}, {"aliases": ["RInky-dink"], "pen_names": ["ヤジマ電機_・サワシ・二秒"], "position": "H - 11", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/RInky-dink.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/RInky-dink.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://rinky-dink.wix.com/rinky-dink", "https://twitter.com/Seconds_Two", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=13772230", "http://www.nicovideo.jp/user/2944418"], "comments": "音楽性の違いにより結成しました。鏡音リン・レンによるラブソングオンリーの1stアルバム「レモングラス」、青黒・鏡音リンのポスカ。新作は、おはようからお休みまでをサポートする鏡音ボイス集、缶バッチやシールを予定しています。"}, {"aliases": ["BANANA///（バナナレジメンタルストライプス）"], "pen_names": ["M.I.K.A. / Merry=S."], "position": "H - 12", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/BANANA（バナナレジメンタルストライプス）.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/BANANA（バナナレジメンタルストライプス）.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://wondercraftlabel.blog.fc2.com/", "https://twitter.com/@abemikaakaabe3", "http://www.nicovideo.jp/user/107598"], "comments": "鏡音リン・レンのオリジナル曲ＣＤを中心にドット絵モチーフの缶バッジなどのグッズも取り扱うサークル。関西発上陸です、よろしくお願いします！"}, {"aliases": ["畢竟ヒロイン論考"], "pen_names": ["ムラサメ"], "position": "H - 13", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/畢竟ヒロイン論考.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/畢竟ヒロイン論考.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/murasame_nc", "http://www.nicovideo.jp/user/44205056"], "comments": "初めてのサークル参加です。いろんな音をつくっています。オリジナルの恋愛シリーズものからあきづき空太先生作品のイメージソング集まで。お話しだけでもどんとこい。どうぞよしなに。"}, {"aliases": ["きいろ屋"], "pen_names": ["じゃんぼ@家族愛P"], "position": "H - 14", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/きいろ屋.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/きいろ屋.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://kazokuai-p.ldblog.jp/", "https://twitter.com/jumbo256", "http://www.nicovideo.jp/user/9786769"], "comments": "レンくんでポップスやってます！メロディアスでキャッチーな90年代集まれ！"}, {"aliases": ["いーえっくすおあ"], "pen_names": ["ぴょろP、そらうた"], "position": "H - 15", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/いーえっくすおあ.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/いーえっくすおあ.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://exor.iza-yoi.net/", "https://twitter.com/pyorop", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=15460740", "http://www.nicovideo.jp/user/352671"], "comments": "たぶんレンV4XのシングルCDが出ます！以前に頒布した鏡音ダイスは、新たなデザインを加えて頒布しますのでお楽しみに！"}, {"aliases": ["Shinycolor Creates"], "pen_names": ["奉行P"], "position": "H - 16", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/Shinycolor Creates.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/Shinycolor　Creates.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://fhroom.blog32.fc2.com/", "https://twitter.com/bugyou0201", "http://www.nicovideo.jp/user/3562069"], "comments": "リンレンラピストリオアルバムを持っていきます。他コンピCD委託、グッズで新作を用意する予定です！よろしくお願い致します。"}, {"aliases": ["w.a.y"], "pen_names": ["葉之月"], "position": "H - 17", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/w.a.y.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/w.a.y.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://ahp.xii.jp/ahpway/", "https://twitter.com/hanotsuki", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=204033", "http://www.nicovideo.jp/user/2096179"], "comments": "鏡音レンが歌うＣＤを頒布中！ 昨年末に企画した鏡音レンコンピレーションアルバム第二弾【ＬＣ?】も頒布予定です！"}, {"aliases": ["つきねこ製作所"], "pen_names": ["つきのP"], "position": "H - 18", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/つきねこ製作所.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/つきねこ製作所.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://kitsutsukinowa.blog99.fc2.com/", "https://twitter.com/tsukinop_nyau", "http://www.nicovideo.jp/user/6746422"], "comments": "鏡音レン民族調曲中心です。ほよほよ飼育係(応援歌P、つきのP、ニクロムP)のCDも頒布します。新作も出るかも・・・？"}, {"aliases": ["キラキラキャンディ"], "pen_names": ["いちは"], "position": "H - 19", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/キラキラキャンディ.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/キラキラキャンディ.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://haribote.daa.jp/", "https://twitter.com/18o_o81", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=478134"], "comments": "もじゅみね・青藍黒蘇の漫画を細々描いてます。新刊やグッズなども作っていきたいと思いますのでよろしくお願いします。"}, {"aliases": ["ドクダミ"], "pen_names": ["ぺぺん"], "position": "H - 20", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/ドクダミ.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/ドクダミ.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://nanos.jp/dokudami0423/", "https://twitter.com/pepen_twin", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=2401396"], "comments": "レンリンオンリーの小説サークルです。パンキッシュ×チアフルキャンディもあります。"}, {"aliases": ["いい天気だね"], "pen_names": ["たけむ"], "position": "H - 21", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/いい天気だね.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/いい天気だね.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/takemudesu", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=3309750"], "comments": "小説中心サークルです。和風ファンタジー鏡音本だします！既刊の英国風みね、パンチア合同本あります。もじゅみねイメージブレスレット持って行きます。よろしくおねがいします！"}, {"aliases": ["DaisyBell"], "pen_names": ["和音"], "position": "H - 22", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/DaisyBell.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/DaisyBell.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://adabanayuugi.web.fc2.com/index.html", "https://twitter.com/kazune0waon", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=2862317"]}, {"aliases": ["鏡音小説倶楽部"], "pen_names": ["つつの・ささめ"], "position": "H - 23", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/鏡音小説倶楽部.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/鏡音小説倶楽部.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://kagamineclub.wa-sanbon.com/index.html", "https://twitter.com/tuno_club"], "comments": "『ささめごと』のささめ＆『つの部屋』のつつのが鏡音字書きさんをお招きしてテーマごとに小説本を発行している鏡音合同小説サークルです。既刊のR18アンソロジーや新刊合同誌、個人誌の頒布を予定しています。"}, {"aliases": ["Ecliptic"], "pen_names": ["szaki"], "position": "H - 24", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/Ecliptic.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/Ecliptic.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/szakijpn", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=180599", "http://www.nicovideo.jp/user/5106890"], "comments": "szakiがこれまであちこちに書いてきた小説を本にまとめました。書き下ろしもあります。"}, {"aliases": ["草蛇姫"], "pen_names": ["花闇秋奈"], "position": "H - 25", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/草蛇姫.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/草蛇姫.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/HANAYAMILEN23", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=1371292"], "comments": "サークル初参加です。よろしくお願いします"}, {"aliases": ["Cross*Days"], "pen_names": ["しまぱんだ"], "position": "H - 26", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/Cross＊Days.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/Cross＊Days.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/Opanchuuuuuu", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=1180002", "http://www.nicovideo.jp/user/8593377"], "comments": "鏡音レンモジュールのスクールジャージ×生徒会執行部中心。甘々とR18多め。"}, {"aliases": ["SEVENTHSTAR"], "pen_names": ["59"], "position": "H - 27", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/SEVENTHSTAR.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/SEVENTHSTAR.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/gocue_59", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=1689485"], "comments": "レンリンほのぼの&シリアス、学ラン★パーカー×生徒会執行部BL、ミクリン、メイルカ百合等 レンリン冬コミ新刊も持っていきます！"}, {"aliases": ["ディッピン*ドッツ"], "pen_names": ["陽夏"], "position": "H - 28", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/ディッピンドッツ.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/ディッピンドッツ.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/hina_pdv", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=9004296"], "comments": "もじゅみね中心、青藍・黒蘇を愛でつつ今回は新刊でパンアシの小説を出したいと思っています。可愛くて癒やしのもじゅみねが大好きです！"}, {"aliases": ["どろんじょ☆"], "pen_names": ["なじょ+まどろみ"], "position": "H - 35", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/どろんじょ☆.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/どろんじょ☆.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/nazyorin"]}, {"aliases": ["きいろぽっと"], "pen_names": ["のちょ"], "position": "H - 37", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/きいろぽっと.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/きいろぽっと.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/nnoocchhoo", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=286101"], "comments": "デフォみね、もじゅみね本あります。本、グッズ。"}, {"aliases": ["Wonderland"], "pen_names": ["涼"], "position": "H - 38", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/Wonderland.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/Wonderland.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/suzumi503", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=247657"], "comments": "鏡音の同人誌を多数取り揃えております。ボカロ設定中心ですがモジュールもちょこっとあります。新刊は学パロ本の予定です。"}, {"aliases": ["SUNNY SIDE UP"], "pen_names": ["macozi"], "position": "H - 39", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/SUNNY SIDE UP.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/SUNNY SIDE UP.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://macozzz02.wix.com/sunny-side-up", "https://twitter.com/loco_mo02", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=4234106", "http://www.nicovideo.jp/user/24371497"], "comments": "初参加です！同人誌とポストカードを配布予定です。宜しくお願いします(^^*)"}, {"aliases": ["まるごとバナナ"], "pen_names": ["鯖いちゃ/ぴぉん/ざむち"], "position": "H - 40", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/まるごとバナナ.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/まるごとバナナ.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/zamhappytheory"]}, {"aliases": ["box"], "pen_names": ["みさや"], "position": "H - 41", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/box.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/box.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/misaya_338", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=4354750"], "comments": "初参加です。右も左も分かりませんが、好きなものを好きなだけ創作しています。"}, {"aliases": ["Calling"], "pen_names": ["霧ヶ峰零"], "position": "H - 42", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/Calling.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/Calling.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://mirroract22ppwcss.web.fc2.com/", "https://twitter.com/act22ppwcss", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=7602155"]}, {"aliases": ["ちょこみかん"], "pen_names": ["りり"], "position": "H - 43", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/ちょこみかん.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/ちょこみかん.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/riri_102", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=3370474"], "comments": "新刊学パロ本出る予定です！既刊のデフォみね本も持っていきます。グッズとかも出せたらいいな･･･。よろしくお願い致します！"}, {"aliases": ["G.C.M Records"], "pen_names": ["アンメルツP"], "position": "H - 44", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/G.C.M Records.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/G.C.M Records.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://www.gcmstyle.com/", "https://twitter.com/gcmstyle", "http://www.nicovideo.jp/user/3172678"], "comments": "アンメルツPの個人サークル。鏡音30秒着信音コンピ『30LRC』、大規模鏡音コンピCD＆画集『kagamination』など、各種鏡音コンピCDや個人CDを頒布します。"}, {"aliases": ["撫子ロック"], "pen_names": ["塩"], "position": "H - 45", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/撫子ロック.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/撫子ロック.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://seeeeshow.blog.fc2.com/", "https://twitter.com/seeeeshow", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=2696741"]}, {"aliases": ["ミルク風味の鈴カステラ"], "pen_names": ["CastellaP、兎月ざくろ"], "position": "H - 46", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/ミルク風味の鈴カステラ.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/ミルク風味の鈴カステラ.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://castella.cv02.net/", "https://twitter.com/CastellaP", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=1966078", "http://www.nicovideo.jp/user/18846427"], "comments": "鏡音ボカロPのCastellaP＆イラスト担当の兎月ざくろのユニットサークルです！"}, {"aliases": ["絶版少年"], "pen_names": ["ゼッパン"], "position": "H - 47", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/絶版少年.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/絶版少年.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/zeppann.sakura.ne.jp/"], "comments": "19世紀を舞台にした歴史物語を連載形式で続けてます。地味ぃ〜です。賑やかしにスク水のレンくんを登場させたいのですが予定は未定。"}, {"aliases": ["Melody Line"], "pen_names": ["Melody Line"], "position": "H - 48", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/Melody Line.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/Melody Line.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/Melody_line5", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=6953000"]}, {"aliases": ["ぼ館"], "pen_names": ["bkn"], "position": "H - 49", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/ぼ館.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/ぼ館.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/bkkkkkn", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=205026"], "comments": "ブラックスター＆ブルームーンのタッグ結成話（小説本）が出る予定（予定）"}, {"aliases": ["10th Tempter"], "pen_names": ["北野てん"], "position": "H - 50", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/10th Tempter.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/10th Tempter.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/10der_foot", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=1056809"], "comments": "好きなもの×好きなもの＝もっと好き！鏡音と刀剣乱舞クロスオーバー本がある予定です。"}, {"aliases": ["DOG THEATER"], "pen_names": ["犬飼陽"], "position": "H - 51", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/DOG THEATER.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/DOG THEATER.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/7_24inukai", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=264650", "http://www.nicovideo.jp/user/26905171"], "comments": "ナナミPのリシェラティアシリーズCDアートワークまとめ本が出したいです。他にもなにか突発的なイラスト本かグッズでも出せたらなと！既刊も色々持っていくのでよろしくおねがいします。"}, {"aliases": ["ぽむ屋"], "pen_names": ["ぽむぽっぽ"], "position": "H - 52", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/ぽむ屋.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/ぽむ屋.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/pompoppo", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=1207304"], "comments": "鏡音、もじゅみねのほのぼの漫画"}, {"aliases": ["ＲＯＴ"], "pen_names": ["初・陸"], "position": "H - 53", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/ＲＯＴ.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/ＲＯＴ.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/buri_ui068", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=53851"]}, {"aliases": ["３レン腐"], "pen_names": ["クリスタルP、れれれP、キッド"], "position": "H - 55, 56", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/３レン腐.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/３レン腐.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://yaplog.jp/kidsworks/", "https://twitter.com/kid_NnDS", "http://www.nicovideo.jp/user/8978552"], "comments": "クリスタルP、れれれP、キッドPによるオリジナル音楽を中心としたサークルです。"}, {"aliases": ["碧茶園"], "pen_names": ["碧茶"], "position": "H - 57", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/碧茶園.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/碧茶園.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/HekiCha", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=25311"], "comments": "鏡音レンメインのイラストサークルです。"}, {"aliases": ["なごみ系"], "pen_names": ["ウインディー"], "position": "H - 58", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/なごみ系.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/なごみ系.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/eiennnosannsai", "http://www.nicovideo.jp/user/5822894"]}, {"aliases": ["みっち＆融合の発表会"], "pen_names": ["みっち（かいわれP）、融合P"], "position": "H - 59, 60", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/みっち＆融合の発表会.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/みっち＆融合の発表会.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://habcy.bitter.jp/"]}, {"aliases": ["蝶々結び"], "pen_names": ["ナナミP"], "position": "H - 62", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/蝶々結び.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/蝶々結び.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://sound.jp/nanase615/x/", "https://twitter.com/na_na_mi_p", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=2168986", "http://www.nicovideo.jp/user/1054158"], "comments": "鏡音リン＆レンで民族調・物語調の音楽CDを作っています。その他、ハンドメイドのアクセサリー等。物語CDシリーズ・リシェラティアの最終章が出ます。お立ち寄り頂けたら嬉しいです♪"}, {"aliases": ["防腐剤"], "pen_names": ["めっさー"], "position": "H - 63", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/防腐剤.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/防腐剤.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/herms02"], "comments": "NLBLGLごちゃまぜのもじゅみね短編小説集を出しますー！初めてですが不手際のないよう頑張ります、みなさんよろしくお願いします！れっつかがみね！"}, {"aliases": ["イエロープラネット"], "pen_names": ["八雲ひかり"], "position": "H - 64", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/イエロープラネット.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/イエロープラネット.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/YakumoHikari", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=851365"], "comments": "初参加です。アクリルキーホルダーとなるべくコピー本も持っていけるよう頑張ります！"}, {"aliases": ["かざみどり"], "pen_names": ["sera"], "position": "H - 65", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/かざみどり.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/かざみどり.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://ameblo.jp/seraira/", "https://twitter.com/seramicc"], "comments": "鏡音リンのねんどろいど写真集やボカロモジュールイメージのシュシュを頒布予定です！"}, {"aliases": ["あじゃりんくえすと"], "pen_names": ["ソラサラ/キチキチ法師/ユキハネ"], "position": "H - 66", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/あじゃりんくえすと.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/あじゃりんくえすと.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["http://harmonyofcolor.blog.fc2.com/", "https://twitter.com/sorasara2525", "http://www.pixiv.net/member.php?id=133928"], "comments": "グッズ中心です。アクリルキーホルダー、バッチなど。3人で活動していますので色んな鏡音を楽しんでいただけます♪"}, {"aliases": ["Sextuor de Licorne"], "pen_names": ["ツバサ"], "position": "H - 67, 68", "media": [{"path": "01_cuts/Sextuor de Licorne.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358im_/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/circlecut/Sextuor de Licorne.png", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "links": ["https://twitter.com/kagami_oto"], "comments": "初参加です。メンバー6人による鏡音オンリーのイラスト集、その他グッズを出します。よろしくお願いいたします！"}], "sources": [{"source": "Date: https://web.archive.org/web/20160223054351/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/index.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}, {"source": "Participating circles: https://web.archive.org/web/20160426054358/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp:80/circle_list.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}], "media": [{"path": "1_20160223054351_top.png", "sources": [{"source": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160223054351/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/index.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}]}], "comments": "On twitter https://x.com/KagaOcha, one can get most circle images in higher quality. TODO perhaps.\nOn twitter, one can get images here https://web.archive.org/web/20160307153428/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/plan/illust.html but without the watermarks.", "description": "Simultaneous with VOCALOID PARADISE 関西5.", "locations": [{"coordinates": [35.01365, 135.7809429], "address": "9-1 Okazaki Seishojicho, Sakyo Ward, Kyoto, 606-8343, Japan", "description": "京都みやこめっせ 3F", "sources": [{"source": "Same as VOCALOID PARADISE 関西5 https://web.archive.org/web/20160223054351/http://kagamine-no-ochakai.jp/index.html", "type": ["Reliable", "Official"]}], "imageUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gps-cs-s/AHRPTWlur6oWztq77DaOuTZLw5MRyj3iDVD1CD-wl9_7wkEXC7e9JYhls5YX8XY6_936CE_RWP6CozLolZI73Mh7gleO-PgU9DJro4VpNaq7nQSPaHd9rChZ-VVge7urD47mbsVOMZ6B-A=s870-k-no", "url": "https://maps.app.goo.gl/8MjxYFEFKBxjhyTT8"}], "last_edited": "2026.08.05"}